@startuml VIS03-Reload-Assembly-Line
title VIS03 - Reload after a WEB06 configuration change

actor "Manager" as Manager
participant "WEB06 API" as API
participant "VIS01 viewer" as Viewer
participant "Old ViewerEngine" as Old
participant "New ViewerEngine" as New

Manager -> API : activate extended layout
API --> Manager : activation confirmed
Manager -> Viewer : open or reload kitchen viewer
opt previous viewer attempt exists
  Viewer -> Old : dispose previous attempt
  Old -> Old : abort pending work and stop frames
  Old -> Old : detach line, release module resources and loaded assets
end
Viewer -> API : GET /api/v1/kitchen-configurations/active
API --> Viewer : extended configuration and asset references
Viewer -> Viewer : validate response and preload referenced assets
alt response or asset load fails
  Viewer --> Manager : show VIS01 failure status
else response and assets ready
  Viewer -> New : load new attempt (see SD 1)
  alt build completes
    New --> Viewer : ready for first render
    Viewer -> New : start and render
    Viewer --> Manager : show extended room and SOUTH line
  else build fails
    New --> Viewer : failure
    Viewer --> Manager : show VIS01 failed state
  end
end
@enduml
